    "title": "2026 World Baseball Classic: How to watch the USA vs. Venezuela WBC final game tonight",
    "text": "Team USA will face Venezuela in the final game of the 2026 World Baseball Classic tonight, marking the end of a wild and exciting tournament. This year's WBC final marks the first time that Venezuela has ever competed in the championship game, but after defeating defending champs Japan in the quarterfinal and taking down Italy in a thrilling semifinal, they've rightfully earned their spot. Team USA punched their ticket to their third straight final after defeating the Dominican Republic in their semifinal game. The U.S. has won the competition once before, in 2017. Both teams have a 5-1 record at the tournament, which certainly makes it hard to predict which of them has the edge in tonight's game.The USA vs. Venezuela game will air on Fox and FOX Deportes tonight at 8 p.m. ET. The game will also stream on FOX One. Here's everything you need to know about how to watch tonight's World Baseball Classic final.AdvertisementDate: Tuesday, March 17Time: 8 p.m. ETChannels: Fox, Fox DeportesStreaming: FOX One, DirecTV, Fubo & moreUSA vs. Venezuela WBC final game time: The Venezuela vs. USA game at the World Baseball Classic will take place tonight, March 17, at 8 p.m. ET.USA vs. Venezuela WBC game channel:The USA vs. Venezuela game will be broadcast live on Fox and in Spanish on FOX Deportes.Where to watch the World Baseball Classic final without cableEvery single World Baseball Classic game will stream on FOX One. You can also catch tonight's game on Fox on live TV platforms like DirecTV and Fubo.FOX One is a new streaming service from FOX that launched in 2025. With a subscription to FOX One, you can tune in to all your favorite FOX channels like FOX News, FOX Sports, FOX Weather, FS1, FS2, FOX Business, FOX Deportes, Big Ten Network (B1G), and local FOX stations all in one place, and this year, they'll be streaming every single game of the 2026 World Baseball Classic. FOX One offers live programming, as well as shows and movies on demand. The base price for FOX One will cost $19.99 a month, or you can save with an annual subscription for $199.99.",
